88
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:12,060
What'd I do?

89
00:03:12,050 --> 00:03:13,050
What'd I do?

90
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,060
- Hang on now!
- Feel sick.

91
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:19,060
