you, Servo, I love you, Crow.

133
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:35,140
- I love you, Gypsy, I love
you, Mike, I love you, Servo.

134
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:37,140
- I love you, Gypsy,
I love you, Mike.

135
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:39,140
