145
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,660
No!

146
00:04:58,660 --> 00:05:00,160
(furious sobbing)

147
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,670
No!

148
00:05:01,660 --> 00:05:04,160
(furious sobbing)

149
00:05:05,670 --> 00:05:06,170
- Oh!

150
00:05:07,170 --> 00:05:08,670
