162
00:05:29,690 --> 00:05:31,200
- Well, I mean, we didn't
really do it, but...

163
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,690
- Well, it was done by someone!

164
00:05:32,690 --> 00:05:34,190
- Yes, someone did it!

165
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:36,200
- It was done!
- Yay!

166
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,700
- Woooooo!
- Hurrah!

167
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,700
- Hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo!

168
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:42,200
- There, there.

169
00:05:44,210 --> 00:05:44,710
Ooh.

170
00:05:46,210 --> 00:05:47,210
- Oh.

171
00:05:48,210 --> 00:05:51,720
So you're coming
back to Earth, huh?

172
00:05:51,710 --> 00:05:53,210
