251
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:22,620
(Servo humming)

252
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:26,120
- [Mike] Oh, there it goes, the
liquid center just exploded.

253
00:09:26,130 --> 00:09:27,630
Oh.

254
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:30,640
- [Servo] The Young
Mr. Boston Story.

255
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:36,630
